      "value": "@{5a995d0bbf71f62789f7311d|full_name}: That's useful if you're trying something quick, but if you're just with people in a world that has a lot of chairs or grabbable objects while you're interacting with others (examples would include saltybet for chairs, or hangout and sleep for objects) it'd be nice to turn those interactions off to minimize accidental movements into chairs or grabbing objects. Especially with both things taking away from one's experience and immersion.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
